# What the image build never reads. The build context is everything not listed here, so a change to a file listed here does not change the
# context of "COPY ." and does not make the build layer (and all that follow) run again.
.github
.gitignore
.gitleaks.toml
.env
.env.example
CLAUDE.local.md
docs
e2e
*.md
screenshot.gif
favicon.psd
**/node_modules
# NOT listed: .git. The build puts the commit id in the binary (git rev-parse in the Makefile), so it needs it.
# the local Go toolchains of a developer (several hundred MB); the image downloads its own
go_1.23
